'' ...AND A LINK WHOSE EXE IS GONE IS MADE (tiko-build B5): the same warm build after the output
'' directory was emptied -- the exe and its '.link' record with it -- links again.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TKO_MODCACHE=build/.blrc/cache
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' CLEAN: build/.blrc
'' CLEAN: build/.blr
'' COPY: tests/driver/src/unitcache => build/.blrs
'' STEP: build -target win64-msvc build/.blrs/a.tiko build/.blrs/b.tiko -o build/.blr/app.exe
'' STEP: build -target win64-msvc build/.blrs/a.tiko build/.blrs/b.tiko -o build/.blr/app.exe
'' CLEAN: build/.blr
'' ARGS: build -target win64-msvc build/.blrs/a.tiko build/.blrs/b.tiko -o build/.blr/app.exe -v
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: is up to date
'' RUN: build/.blr/app.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: b says 7
